hould remain repaired when you return."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The scores will follow those experiences. They will not improve because the work took longer, used a bigger model, or looks impressive in one carefully chosen view."}]]}]]}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]]
